# Prisma schema

Vocabulary at the boundary: Prisma `User` / table `users` maps to domain `Chef` — see `AGENTS.md` (do not rename the model to `Chef` in the schema).

- Prisma enums use PascalCase (`Easy`, `Draft`); domain enums use lowercase — convert only in `src/infra/database/prisma/mappers/enum-mappers.ts`, not in use cases.
- New migration: edit `schema.prisma`, then `pnpm prisma migrate dev --name <descriptive_snake_case>`. Never edit a migration that was already applied in shared environments.
- After schema edits, run `pnpm prisma format` on `prisma/schema.prisma`.
